    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The reason it is not there mostly because there is no \"show/hide\" functionality. It was designed to be done with `vim.g.minitrailspace_disable` / `vim.b.minitrailspace_disable` possibly followed by call to `MiniTrailspace.highlight()`.\r\n\r\nDoes adding the next function work for you?\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n_G.toggle_trailspace = function()\r\n  vim.b.minitrailspace_disable = not vim.b.minitrailspace_disable\r\n  MiniTrailspace.highlight()\r\nend\r\n```\r\n\r\nUse `vim.g` if you want to toggle globally instead of only for current buffer.",
            "created_at": "2023-02-13T14:12:41Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/227#issuecomment-1428006566",
